Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: edge_equivalence (validates ADR 0005)
Purpose:
    Run edge-level (R-instance) equivalence classification on the same six
    canonical graphs used for ADR 0004's identifier-level demo. Check that
    the predicted class counts match the oracle in ADR 0005. Note any
    surprises worth logging for the next layer's design.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0005 (RSignature = pair of endpoint 0-hop signatures).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0005.
    Runner: v2/examples/edge_equivalence.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example edge_equivalence

